{
 "source": "Codex CLI 0.163.0 (codex-cli 0.163.0, /usr/lib/openai-codex/bin/codex) in a private tmux server, 160x45, inside bwrap with no network. A throwaway CODEX_HOME logged in with a placeholder key, its model provider pointed at a local fake Responses API (wire_api=responses) whose replies the probe chose: response.failed with error code server_is_overloaded, insufficient_quota or slow_down, an HTTP 503, or an ordinary reply. Hooks installed by scripts/ticket-board-install-pane-hooks (--seed-codex-hook-trust-if-new), wrapped to record each call. Captured 2026-10-16 for SYRD-594.",
